                "textId": "Performance_1304001_3223616424_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "同时，奇迹花车正在以「种星奇遇季」为题、\n征集优秀新闻素材。\n虽然还是实习主播，我和咕咕会……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_1304001_3223616424_content",
                "value": "同时，奇迹花车正在以「种星奇遇季」为题、\n征集优秀新闻素材。\n虽然还是实习主播，我和咕咕会……",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3223616424
            },
            {
